Source-landscape note: Broad searches covered UN/OHCHR, OSCE/European institutions, Russian and international human-rights organizations, official/legal records, government country reports, academic work, and reputable reporting in English, Russian, German, and French. The candidate universe includes domestic state abuse, political imprisonment, protest policing, Chechnya and vulnerable groups, oversight/remedy, emergency powers, coercive-force control, and the Wagner crisis. Search results remain leads; no claims or scores are assigned.

